id: CTB-LXM-DEC-000017-adopt
kind: decision
decision: LXM-DEC-000017
action: adopt
outcome: Option (a), this push only: the Master session writes to the repository once, as new branches pushed from a fresh clone outside iCloud, never the integration branch, never a force-push; amazon-62 stays the sole writer for everything else
effect: LXM-REQ-000216 records the one-time exception
authorizes: SRC-0028 §0.3, LXM-REQ-000216
adopted: 2026-10-31, by the owner, Bipin Kumar (identity as stated: bipin.kumar@aol.com, bipin1@gmail.com; not verified by the gate)
